 training ground.\n\nFruit-Zen: After the chaos, find your peace. Enter a serene world where you can slice and shoot fruits in a calming environment. \ud83c\udf43\ud83c\udf49\n\nDo you have what it takes to emerge victorious and be Still Alive? ", "short_description": "Step into the apocalypse with 4 intense game modes:\n\nSurvive: Battle endless waves of zombies with limited resources.\nProtect: Defend civilians until rescue arrives.\nTrain: Master your aim and movement.\nFruit-Zen: Unwind by slicing fruits in a serene setting. \ud83c\udf43\ud83c\udf49\nCan you stay Still Alive?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fakesouls.com/privacy-policy-still-alive", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fake Souls", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fakesouls.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24228704203460205"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507827918_1546706863138644_8378979585856366341_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nv4G04HgDtcQ7kNvwECFMLH&_nc_oc=AdpesXJeC6gMOcg1W_xWhZ_ag4GuhxM9v8u1ESe4ynrKLJubrYaeuW9AXdz5f6qj68I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss